          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You are able to rapidly discern relevant details about your opponents in the heat of combat. When you use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Combat Assessment] against a target that you or an ally has targeted with a Strike or spell since the start of your last turn, you get a +2 circumstance bonus to the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Recall Knowledge] check (+4 if the Strike from Combat Assessment is a critical hit.)</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
